  "subject": "Comparing Mortgage Rates Saved Users Thousands on Average",
  "date": "Tue, 20 Oct 2026 01:32:29 +0000",
  "body_text": "大原,\nview your exclusive mortgage offers from Bankrate, a perk of your\nJournal Collection subscription.   Real lenders bid against each\nother for your loan — plus exclusive discounts for Journal\nCollection subscribers. ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ ͏‌ Presented by\nThe Journal Collection       Bankrate mortgage rates beat 99.7%\nof banks. We make lenders compete for your loan until the best\nrate wins, plus special lender offers for Journal Collection\nsubscribers. Start saving. \n( https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/h1gJ0JJ-7XWUmiKiDsMSWQ~~/AAQRxRA~/x3Bhy_sAbLYfSZUtF9US29ThX0wP3A7XFHOzS8oQ6BST74Hp_sIe3I73t5Q4FcE4qmlmnqloFD7bhUxZ9yxmQPjx62UZMi79rLenFDPc4UtYdCeSagmDIgpVkLtiEnqBx4FBMrTiFbXnF34lMHX0pzYHb5ml5XLQUfpifsCdEb6kbLK2bn-kogvMmE34DYlYUUi7bBnvkhryb0qlyEFs5A~~ )\n             For Journal Collection Subscribers\n\n*********************************************\nBankrate mortgage rates beat 99.7% of banks.*\n*********************************************\n\nWe make lenders compete for your loan until the best rate wins,\nplus special lender offers for Journal Collection subscribers.\n\nStart Saving \n( https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/4C5gTzNN9SdbD4D2K7NDrA~~/AAQRxRA~/x3Bhy_sAbLYfSZUtF9US29ThX0wP3A7XFHOzS8oQ6BST74Hp_sIe3I73t5Q4FcE4qmlmnqloFD7bhUxZ9yxmQPjx62UZMi79rLenFDPc4Uvrj79OYnA9NXhJSvLG_y1xhnTXAtH8OCYoO3dijDIxycaNEZ9l2nboSQ7w3KDNCKaLOiIGBoVj10LVurRbGKK0rsEDkrTqkZxUTxIjbKs2xw~~ )\n              Hi 大原, as a\nJournal Collection subscriber, you have access to Bankrate's\nprivate mortgage marketplace. Instead of one bank naming its\nprice, real lenders bid against each other in a live auction for\nyour loan — plus exclusive discounts.\n\n-----------------------------------\nSpecial mortgage offers may include\n-----------------------------------\n\nMortgage rate\ndiscount Up to 0.25% off           Closing cost\ncredits Up to $800           Reduced\nappraisal fees Up to $650        Offers vary by lender and\neligibility.\n\nStart Saving \n( https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/vxmgoYgIAvcsBoWV3U5mhQ~~/AAQRxRA~/x3Bhy_sAbLYfSZUtF9US29ThX0wP3A7XFHOzS8oQ6BST74Hp_sIe3I73t5Q4FcE4qmlmnqloFD7bhUxZ9yxmQPjx62UZMi79rLenFDPc4UtAF7z-z0Q1PDaucV28QmiVc_fmwYLzBndHIVf0dAvdCAYRQ_fSkr5hElodDJyTXORRUv1qeFKfC2JEtQZnBRsKdfWZtipSjZrKjLLt8WayLQ~~ )\n\n\n-----------------------------\nWhy compare through Bankrate?\n-----------------------------\n\n$700M+ saved by Bankrate\nmembers every year1    $78K avg saved by Bankrate\nmortgage users over 30 yrs2\n\n------------\nHow it works\n------------\n\nBuying a home, refinancing, or tapping your equity — the same\nJournal Collection benefit works for all three.\n\n1  Share your needs   No credit pull is required\nto see options.\n\n2  Compare offers   See rates and participant benefits\nside by side.\n\n3  Choose your path   Purchase or refinance — move\nforward only when you're ready.\n\nStart Saving \n( https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/UAAtaUmJ-LtBUzwJxzDTgw~~/AAQRxRA~/x3Bhy_sAbLYfSZUtF9US29ThX0wP3A7XFHOzS8oQ6BST74Hp_sIe3I73t5Q4FcE4qmlmnqloFD7bhUxZ9yxmQPjx62UZMi79rLenFDPc4UsiHjxVxE9-4tlDMnMY5nvQ8BKrLyclCllp2Ttxi_E6q_Sh7u4tcbLqVN_PCcK7t8GQHIo2Wv3ONigGDeRClHQrzxUOqqDDoF1WwkMax5zXOQ~~ )\n       No credit pull required · No commitment · No spam calls\n\n* Compares Bankrate's best daily purchase and refi offers\nvs. a survey of bank/credit union offers in 2025, on similar\n30-yr fixed loans. Bankrate figures are clicked quotes, not\nfunded loans. 600+ unique institutions were surveyed (~300 each\nweek). On an avg. day, Bankrate beat about 99.7% of those\nsurveyed on 8-yr cost of loan. Survey covers ~half of bank/credit\nunion loans. Individual results vary.\n\n1 Projected savings on deposit and mortgage products only using\navg rate on each funded product from Bankrate vs. a national\nbenchmark FHLMC 30/15yr avg. for mortgages; FDIC rates for\ndeposits. Mortgage savings projected over an assumed 77-mo. hold;\ndeposit savings over an assumed 6-yr account life. Projected over\nthe products' est. lives, aggregated across all members, not\nrealized in 1 calendar yr. $700M+ = avg. annual total, 2020-25.\n\n2 Bankrate Research, \"The Hidden Homeownership Tax \n( https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/rNrPirhdSY-ymBSlGERGZQ~~/AAQRxRA~/9Fil7sjS9fHAnPOeN52TPzbRm4jvDMCjz2X-HjF3bUtUhfnWbeH7qhIPL1rGXuO5s-C_6ImPz-kogmDF9B4TSLnUQ0DipTLuNBsItATOhq0S9xjHSMAXzfGZH7H7gvqb3dyT5xSwBP4weblysDFrpwtNoixq0qrC1szS7ZG_-zVnnmq7A-We-WCobCxiaReh )\n\" (2026). Based on 3M+ 2025 HMDA reported originations with a\ncomparable Bankrate benchmark, not all loans. Est. lifetime cost\nof each borrower's actual loan vs. Bankrate's most-competitive\nmatched offer. $78,186 = proj. avg. across evaluated loans,\nassuming each held to term; savings lower for those who sell or\nrefi. Individual results vary.\n\nBankrate is not a lender.\n\nBankrate, LLC NMLS ID# 1427381 | NMLS Consumer Access \n( https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/096UcvQJ7F3U8EwHyUf33Q~~/AAQRxRA~/mQapsWjasY3ADAYCWpAq29PfIWNzx1hXFbuEZvnGbnRWBGXIatSnlodhit6KMMIt-XdJp5nOmMC3M22zmpv6-cN49moR9gD0FzvFvhJyIlRb6s2J7yCKkBQz0BWoL19kMVClnTJzK5MiA97w9ORhMg~~ )\nBR Tech Services, Inc. NMLS ID #1743443 | NMLS Consumer Access \n( https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/YKSaOjdXYbOfPShgCbr1KA~~/AAQRxRA~/mQapsWjasY3ADAYCWpAq29PfIWNzx1hXFbuEZvnGbnRWBGXIatSnlodhit6KMMItGRR3T5vFGONzwfu4BOFH95tkoudu25KFvUWon7TzPH4K8qlCHwhKXPCp9utf6qAOFem45UnmhK66dS0aE78OoQ~~ )\n\nThis mailing was sent to\nteruyuki@hh.iij4u.or.jp,\nbecause you are subscribed to receive The Journal Collection\nnewsletter.\n\nCertain offers or invites may include additional terms or\nlimitations, and may not be available to subscribers under 21\nyears of age.\n\nUnsubscribe ( https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/v7Sxc-Og04IW6-2I_YBG3Q~~/AAQRxRA~/NYJrAkJj-x6l4-q-ACa5lu2IaaS4WqK7vwE-HB6J-Fi0sKGl574YcDiqdybhADW6TgUgpf5FuM_vFhrtjSyK-PrLSjk4KGCyIqCuBzQfteKjrXJBBsHq-kIZkcbISMdi073ee8nXZNvov_dsnqUabsB_SEJhWVbocmVv20-KgMv9sL-S2iJ4DSAr59yoQ5b9WiqJ5PvN1_G7NVL8M5QWAlig5yUk0_v6JI0yEfBm9E_pzUPocOffKUOioCglAeJt_UIJHSLexUYDhra7T2azvUOag2XORb683Nz7uMO