             </tr>\r\n            </table>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n\r\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n  <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding-top:40px;\">\r\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" class=\"btn\">\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <!--[if mso]><td bgcolor=\"#0A5CFF\" style=\"background-color:#0A5CFF;border-radius:8px;mso-padding-alt:18px 44px;\" align=\"center\"><![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if !mso]><!--><td bgcolor=\"#0A5CFF\" style=\"background-color:#0A5CFF;background-image:linear-gradient(#0A5CFF,#0A5CFF);border-radius:8px;mso-padding-alt:18px 44px;\" align=\"center\">\n<!--<![endif]-->\r\n          <a href=\"https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/UAAtaUmJ-LtBUzwJxzDTgw~~/AAQRxRA~/x3Bhy_sAbLYfSZUtF9US29ThX0wP3A7XFHOzS8oQ6BST74Hp_sIe3I73t5Q4FcE4qmlmnqloFD7bhUxZ9yxmQPjx62UZMi79rLenFDPc4UsiHjxVxE9-4tlDMnMY5nvQ8BKrLyclCllp2Ttxi_E6q_Sh7u4tcbLqVN_PCcK7t8GQHIo2Wv3ONigGDeRClHQrzxUOqqDDoF1WwkMax5zXOQ~~\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:18px 44px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-font-alt:Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFE;text-decoration:none;\">Start Saving</a>\r\n        </td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n  </td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n      <p class=\"dm-t-muted\" style=\"margin:20px 0 0 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-font-alt:Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-style:italic;color:#6B7280;text-align:center;\">\r\n        No credit pull required · No commitment · No spam calls\r\n      </p>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n\r\n  <!-- DISCLOSURES -->\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#F7F7F8\" class=\"px dm-white-bg dm-t-muted\" style=\"background-color:#F7F7F8;padding:28px 24px 28px 24px;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;mso-font-alt:Arial;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#000000;\">\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">* Compares Bankrate's best daily purchase and refi offers vs. a survey of bank/credit union offers in 2025, on similar 30-yr fixed loans. Bankrate figures are clicked quotes, not funded loans. 600+ unique institutions were surveyed (~300 each week). On an avg. day, Bankrate beat about 99.7% of those surveyed on 8-yr cost of loan. Survey covers ~half of bank/credit union loans. Individual results vary.</p>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\"><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;Projected savings on deposit and mortgage products only using avg rate on each funded product from Bankrate vs. a national benchmark FHLMC 30/15yr avg. for mortgages; FDIC rates for deposits. Mortgage savings projected over an assumed 77-mo. hold; deposit savings over an assumed 6-yr account life. Projected over the products' est. lives, aggregated across all members, not realized in 1 calendar yr. $700M+ = avg. annual total, 2020-25.</p>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\"><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;Bankrate Research, \"<a href=\"https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/rNrPirhdSY-ymBSlGERGZQ~~/AAQRxRA~/9Fil7sjS9fHAnPOeN52TPzbRm4jvDMCjz2X-HjF3bUtUhfnWbeH7qhIPL1rGXuO5s-C_6ImPz-kogmDF9B4TSLnUQ0DipTLuNBsItATOhq0S9xjHSMAXzfGZH7H7gvqb3dyT5xSwBP4weblysDFrpwtNoixq0qrC1szS7ZG_-zVnnmq7A-We-WCobCxiaReh\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#000000;text-decoration:underline;\">The Hidden Homeownership Tax</a>\" (2026). Based on 3M+ 2025 HMDA reported originations with a comparable Bankrate benchmark, not all loans. Est. lifetime cost of each borrower's actual loan vs. Bankrate's most-competitive matched offer. $78,186 = proj. avg. across evaluated loans, assuming each held to term; savings lower for those who sell or refi. Individual results vary.</p>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">Bankrate is not a lender.</p>\r\n      <p style=\"margin:0;\">Bankrate, LLC NMLS ID# 1427381 | <a href=\"https://ablink.dowjones.com/f/a/096UcvQJ7F3U8EwHyUf33Q~~/AAQRxRA~/mQapsWja